# Static frontend conventions

- Keep structure in `index.html`, styling in the matching modular CSS file, and behavior in `assets/js/site.js`.
- Use CSS custom properties from `assets/css/tokens.css`; do not add unexplained hard-coded colors, spacing, or typography values.
- Reuse existing components and section patterns before adding new classes.
- Preserve section IDs, semantic landmarks, visible focus styles, reduced-motion support, and responsive behavior at 390px, 768px, and 1440px.
- Prefer named event listeners or semantic anchors over inline event handlers.
- Do not introduce Tailwind, React, a bundler, or dependencies without explicit approval.
